# Migration assessment: `OVHcloud`

- Inventory file: `inventory.json`
- Source: `aws`
- Catalog: `OVHcloud` snapshot from `https://www.ovhcloud.com/en-ie/public-cloud/prices/`, retrieved 2026-11-13
- Region: `GRA` (the target's default for estimates)

## Summary

| Fit | Resources |
|---|---|
| direct | 6 |
| partial | 2 |
| none | 3 |
| total | 11 |

